BT 1 0 0 1 0 53.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 16 TL (I respectfully submit this letter to apply for a Front-End Developer position at Google Philippines. I) Tj T* (am currently a Bachelor of Science in Information Technology student at Filamer Christian) Tj T* (University, and I would welcome the opportunity to apply my knowledge and gain further) Tj T* (professional experience.) Tj T* ET
