BT 1 0 0 1 0 53.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 16 TL (My technical skills include HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Python, MySQL, and Laravel. I applied some of) Tj T* (these skills in the FCU Library Log-in System, an academic project in which I helped develop the) Tj T* (front-end interface and worked with the database and application features. This gave me practical) Tj T* (exposure to web development and database-driven applications.) Tj T* ET
Q
