BT 1 0 0 1 0 53.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 16 TL (I also participated in the FCU Work Study Program as a working student at the College of Nursing) Tj T* (Office from 2024 to 2025. Through this experience and my academic activities, I developed) Tj T* (communication, teamwork, problem-solving, and organizational skills. I am adaptable, hardworking,) Tj T* (and eager to learn new technologies.) Tj T* ET
